WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.211
Today is a short check, and then a game.

2
00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:09.436
First, name the six pictures together. Their names are printed small, upside down, at the bottom of the box.

3
00:00:09.886 --> 00:00:15.127
Then your child writes each word in its boxes. Say it, tap it, write it, read it back.

4
00:00:15.577 --> 00:00:20.451
Do not help on this page. Mark a word only if every letter is right, and in order.

5
00:00:20.901 --> 00:00:23.155
Five or six right, go on to day six.

6
00:00:23.605 --> 00:00:29.384
Fewer than five, do days two, three and four again, then come back to this page. That is normal.

7
00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:35.423
Then play the game on the next page. Each word is the one before it, with one letter changed.

8
00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:39.645
The word is bat.

9
00:00:43.363 --> 00:00:44.331
The word is hat.

10
00:00:45.231 --> 00:00:48.725
Your child writes each word, and colors the box that changed.
